# Trivy exceptions (dependency, image and IaC findings).
#
# Rules (docs/security/03-politique-de-blocage.md):
#  - every line needs an expiry date (exp:YYYY-MM-DD) and a comment above it
#    with: exception ID, reason, owner;
#  - CRITICAL: 7 days max, HIGH: 30 days max;
#  - the same exception is also listed in docs/security/04-registre-des-exceptions.md.
#
# Example:
# EXC-001 | false positive: code path not reachable | owner: Nour
# CVE-0000-00000 exp:2026-12-31
